 || 7.1.2 ||

 na hy asyārthaḥ sura-gaṇaiḥ sākṣān niḥśreyasātmanaḥ |

  naivāsurebhyo vidveṣo nodvegaś cāguṇasya hi ||

śrīdharaḥ: kiṃ ca, yasya yaiḥ prayojanaṃ sidhyati sa tat pakṣa-pātī
bhavati, yebhyo bibheti tān dveṣeṇa hanti na tu tad atrāstīty āha—na hīti
| niḥśreyasaṃ paramānanda eva ātmā svarūpaṃ yasya | asurebhyaś codvego
bhayaṃ nāsti | ato vidveṣo'pi nāsty eva | tatra hetuḥ—aguṇasyeti |
guṇādhīnau prīti-dveṣāv ity arthaḥ ||2||

krama-sandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ: na cendrādibhis tasya sukhaṃ siddhyatīty atas tat-pakṣapāta
iti vācyam ity āha—neti | niḥśreyasaṃ paramānanda eva ātmā svarūpaṃ yasya
tasya kaścid anyaḥ sukhaṃ sādhayed iti bhāvaḥ | na cāsurādibhir udvejakais
tasya duḥkhaṃ bhaved, yatas teṣu vidveṣaḥ ity āha—naiveti | asurebhya
udvego nāsty ato na vidveṣaḥ | tatra hetuḥ—aguṇasyeti ||2||

—o)0(o—

 || 7.1.3 ||

iti naḥ sumahā-bhāga nārāyaṇa-guṇān prati |

  saṃśayaḥ sumahān jātas tad bhavāṃś chettum arhati ||

śrīdharaḥ: śrī-nārāyaṇasya guṇān anugraha-nigrahādīn prati | tat taṃ
saṃṣayam ||3||

krama-sandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ: guṇān anugraha-nigrahādīn prati ||3||

