 || 7.1.33 ||

mātṛ-ṣvasreyo vaś caidyo dantavakraś ca pāṇḍava |

pārṣada-pravarau viṣṇor vipra-śāpāt pada-cyutau ||

madhvaḥ: svato bhaktyāś caidyādayo'pi parāveśād dveṣiṇaḥ ity atra
hetu-mātṛ-ṣvasreya ity ādi ||33||

śrīdharaḥ : tad evam itihāsa-prastāva-kathām uktvā śrī-kṛṣṇe śiśupālasya
vairānubandhe ko hetur ity apekṣāyāṃ tam evetihāsaṃ vaktum
āha—mātṛ-ṣvasreya iti | padād vaikuṇṭhāc cyutau ||33||

krama-sandarbhaḥ : caidya-dantavaktrau tu nāsurau, kintu hareḥ
sva-bhakti-pravartaka-vipra-kula-dākṣiṇya-maya-svaira-līlecchayā
tad-anukāriṇāv evety abhiprāyaṃ praśnottarābhyāṃ darśayitum
āha—mātṛ-ṣvaseya iti | tatra tayor anyathā-bhāvaḥ sarvathā na sambhavaty
eveti praśnasyārthaḥ, na ca punar āvartate [chā.u. 8.15.1] iti śruteḥ,
anāvṛttiḥ śabdāt [veṣū. 4.4.22] iti nyāyāt, mām upetya tu kaunteya punar
janma na vidyate [gītā 8.16] iti śrī-gītābhyaḥ | sa-nyāyaś caivāsau
siddhāntas tu tatretihāsa-mātram tac ca pūrva-yuktyaiva sambhavatīti
