 || 7.6.4 ||

 tat-prayāso na kartavyo yata āyur-vyayaḥ param |

 na tathā vindate kṣemaṃ mukunda-caraṇāmbujam ||

śrīdharaḥ : atas tad-arthaṃ prayāso na kartavyaḥ, yataḥ prayāsāt paraṃ
