 || 7.6.10 ||

  ko nv artha-tṛṣṇāṃ visṛjet prāṇebhyo'pi ya īpsitaḥ |

 yaṃ krīṇāty asubhiḥ preṣṭhais taskaraḥ sevako vaṇik ||

