 || 7.6.11 ||

  kathaṃ priyāyā anukampitāyāḥ

saṅgaṃ rahasyaṃ rucirāṃś ca mantrān |

suhṛtsu tat-sneha-sitaḥ śiśūnāṃ

kalākṣarāṇām anurakta-cittaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca, katham ? ity-ādi | priyāyāḥ saṅgādikaṃ smaran kathaṃ
tyajeta ? iti tṛtīyenānvayaḥ | mantrān hita-śikṣālāpān | suhṛtsu ca saṅgam
| teṣāṃ snehena sito baddhaḥ | kalāni madhurāṇy akṣarāṇi yeṣāṃ teṣāṃ ca
saṅgam | teṣv anuraktaṃ cittaṃ yasya ||11||

krama-sandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  strī-putrādy-āsakteḥ prābalyaṃ darśayati—katham iti |
priyāyāḥ saṅgādikaṃ smaran kathaṃ tyajet ? iti tṛtīyenānvayaḥ | mantrān
hita-śikṣālāpān | sito baddhaḥ | śiśūnāṃ ca saṅgam ||11||

