 || 7.6.16 ||

vidvān apītthaṃ danujāḥ kuṭumbaṃ

  puṣṇan sva-lokāya na kalpate vai |

  yaḥ svīya-pārakya-vibhinna-bhāvas

  tamaḥ prapadyeta yathā vimūḍhaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tad evaṃ ko gṛheṣu pumān [bhā.pu. 7.6.9] ity-ādi-saptabhiḥ
