 || 7.6.17 ||

  yato na kaścit kva ca kutracid vā

 dīnaḥ svam ātmānam alaṃ samarthaḥ |

  vimocituṃ kāma-dṛśāṃ vihāra-

  krīḍā-mṛgo yan-nigaḍo visargaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tasmāt kaumāra eva bhāgavatān dharmān ācared iti sa-hetukam
upasaṃharati—yata iti | yataḥ kaścid api svam ātmānaṃ mocituṃ na
samarthaḥ, tato nārāyaṇam upeta śaraṇaṃ yātety uttareṇānvayaḥ | asāmarthye
hetuḥ—alaṃ dīno lampaṭaḥ | ataḥ kāmo dṛśi yāsāṃ, tāsāṃ vihāre krīḍāyāṃ
nimitte krīḍā-mṛgaḥ | vihāram iti pṛthak pāṭhe tāsāṃ vihāra-sādhanam
ātmānam | yatas tāsāṃ krīḍā-mṛgaḥ sa ity anvayaḥ | kiṃ ca, yad yāsu
nigaḍaḥ śṛṅkhalā-tulyo visargaḥ putra-pautrādi-rūpo bhavati ||17||

