alaṃ na śaknoti | vihāram iti pāṭhe ātmānam ity asya viśeṣaṇam |
samāsa-pāṭhe kartṛ-viśeṣaṇam | yāḥ kāmadṛśa eva nigaḍo yatra tathā-vidhaḥ
sargo janma bhavet ||17||

