tad etat sarvaṃ nigamasyārtha-jātaṃ sva-suhṛdaḥ svāntaryāmiṇaḥ paramasya
puṃsaḥ svātmārpaṇa-sādhanaṃ cet tarhi sarvaṃ satyaṃ manye, satya-paratvāt
