yasya | saṃsṛti-cakra-śātanaṃ tan-nivartakaṃ budhā viduḥ | tad eva
brahmaṇi nirvāṇaṃ layo mokṣas tad-ātmakaṃ sukhaṃ viduḥ | hṛd-īśvaram
