āha—adhokṣajasyālambhaṃ manasā īṣat sparśam sākṣāt prāptiṃ vā
saṃsṛti-cakrasya śātanaṃ nivartakaṃ vidur jānanti | tad eva
brahma-nirvāṇa-sukhaṃ ca adhokṣajasyaiva brahmatvāt
