āyur yasya tasyaite kiyat priyaṃ kurvanti | tad uktam itihāseṣu—

dhanaṃ hi puruṣo loke puruṣaṃ dhanam eva vā |

avaśyam ekaṃ tyajati tasmāt kiṃ dhana-tṛṣṇayā || iti ||39||

