  deśa-kālādi-bhedena punaḥ śreyo-viśeṣa-kṛt ||

gṛha-stham ullaṅghya mokṣaṃ praty antaraṅgatvena prathamaṃ
vana-stha-yati-dharmeṣv abhihiteṣu, tarhi gṛha-sthasya mokṣo na syād iti
