  deśa-kālādi-bhedena dharma uktaś caturdaśe ||

tad evaṃ vratacāri-vānaprastha-yatiṣu tirṣv adhikāriṣu nivṛtta-dharmam
uktvā pravṛtta-dharmam ekasmin gṛhastha evādhikāriṇi vaktuṃ pravartamānaṃ
muniṃ pratyalaṃ pravṛtta-dharmeṇa janma-mṛtyu-pravāhānukūlena vaktavyena,
yadi ca pravṛtta-dharmeṇāpi nivṛtti-dharma-phalaṃ mokṣaḥ siddhyet, tarhi
