āha—ṣaḍ-vargeti | sarvāpi niyama-codanā iṣṭāpūrtādi-vidhayaḥ
ṣaḍ-indriya-vargasya yaḥ saṃyamas tasminn evaikasminn anto yāsām | tad
eka-parā ity arthaḥ | na ca tāvatāpi caritārthā ity āha—tad antāḥ satyo'pi
yadi yogān dhāraṇā-dhyāna-samādhīn no āvaheyur na sādhayeyus tarhi kevalaṃ
